  "text": "We returned, that May, to a pipeline. Thirty-five of us said \"keystone xl pipeline,\" thirty-four said \"the keystone xl pipeline,\" and the count peaked together on the same day, 2013-05-22. John Hoeven had said it first, on 2013-01-22, and by spring we had arrived at the number. Thirty of us said \"the northern route approval act,\" first said by Gus M. Bilirakis. Twenty-seven said \"of the keystone xl\"; twenty-six said \"of the keystone xl pipeline,\" both traced to Tim Walberg.\n\nWe also kept a second file. Twenty-eight of us said \"health care law,\" twenty-five said \"the health care,\" and twenty-four said \"patient protection and affordable care,\" these peaking on 2013-05-16.\n\nTwo phrases, one route and one law, and we converged on each. That is what the record from this era shows of us.",
